Why 1.7.19, not Debian trixie's 1.7.18: trixie ships 1.7.18 plus backported
fixes (CVE-2023-26819, number parsing; CVE-2025-57052, cJSON_Utils only).
1.7.19 is the upstream release that contains them, plus a recursion limit in
cJSON_Duplicate, which the updatedInput builder uses.

Check: sha256sum -c <(sed -n 's/^  \([0-9a-f]\{64\}\)  /\1  /p' README)
